        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "鍛冶屋では、師匠の指示に合わせて向こう鎚が力強く鉄を打つ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "若い向こう鎚は、将来名工になることを夢見て日々修行に励んでいる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "伝統的な鍛冶の現場では、向こう鎚の役割が非常に重要だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "large hammer (used by a smith's assistant)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "職人は、熱い鉄を無骨な向こう鎚で叩き、形を整えていく。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "壁に飾られた古びた向こう鎚は、この家の歴史を物語っているようだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "向こう鎚の重さと、それを振り下ろす鍛冶職人の腕力に圧倒された。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
